# NEVER put these in EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables:
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
# Telegram bot token
# private FCM credentials
# APK signing keystore passwords
# any privileged/admin secret

# Server/Edge-only secrets belong in Supabase/CI/local secret stores and must never be committed.
